window.products.push({"id":280057,"name":"Howard Miller Gorman Grandfather Clock 547-364 – Windsor Cherry with Single-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2010.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wzzjLPkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Gorman Grandfather Clock by Howard Miller has a Windsor Cherry finish with rare olive ash burl overlay. The dial includes corner spandrels, center disk, and silver chapter ring with applied brass Arabic numerals. Illuminated moon phase dial with pierced star pattern. Brass-finished pendulum. Reeded columns, crystal cut V-grooved glass. Cable-driven, single-chime German movement. Howard C. Miller founded the company back in 1926, at the age of 21, and is based out of Zeeland, Michigan. Even though Howard Miller understood the need to create products that would be steeped in quality and value, he expected nothing less than the best. From gaining the title “World’s Largest Grandfather Clock Manufacturer” in the 1960s, to creating collectors cabinets in 1989, all the products have the same attention to detail and handcrafted ideals. We offer hundreds of items to complement any décor ranging from portable alarm clocks to desk sets to wall and mantel clocks to collectors cabinets to limited edition grandfather clocks. No matter the price of the purchase, you have the same assurance that Howard C. Miller provided when he began offering clocks more than 70 years ago: That quality is reflected both in the products we create, and in the people whose artistic talents we rely on to manufacture them. The legacy left by Howard C. Miller isn’t an easy one to emulate. But it’s the only way we know of doing business. Howard Miller offers a warranty which is our promise and commitment that our products have been manufactured using the finest materials and have been thoroughly inspected prior to being shipped from our facilities. Our warranty is available exclusively through authorized retailers only. Please inquire with any 3rd party seller prior to purchase to confirm warranty eligibility. Purchases made from unauthorized retailers will not be eligible for warranty services through Howard Miller or its authorized service center network.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wzzjLPkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B091JBYGR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091JBYGR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091JBYGR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
