window.products.push({"id":280117,"name":"Home Zone CAE6062V 3 Tier Adjustable Corner Shower Caddy, Chrome Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615g3H1OqwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The HomeZone CAE6062V 3 tier adjustable corner shower caddy is the perfect way to add more storage to your shower space. The unique triangular shape allows for versatile, space-saving placement. This caddy has 2 adjustable plastic shelves with easy-to-use flip tabs and 1 fixed metal wire base shelf. The 3-point base construction and height adjustable feet ensure the stability of the shower caddy. There are 2 small hooks for hanging loofahs, razors, wash cloths and other shower necessities. The stylish chrome finish is sure to complement any decor. No tools are required for installation, making it easy to set up this caddy. The HomeZone CAE6062V 3 tier adjustable corner shower caddy is 13.5-Inches long, 10-inches wide, and 33.6-Inches high, making it the ideal size for any bathroom. HomeZone products are both stylish and functional, helping you make the most out of your bathroom space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615g3H1OqwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Zone","source_asin":"B01LWARPI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWARPI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWARPI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})