window.products.push({"id":280213,"name":"Janrely Collapsible Laundry Dirty Clothes Hamper,Collection of Horseback Riding,Large Capacity with Drawstring Storage Bin for Family Waterproof Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aVtVTnrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: Product Size: 19\"(H)x14\"(D) / 48.5(H) x 35.5(D)cm approx. Product Size: 21.6\"(H) x 16.5\"(D)/55(H) x 42(D)cm approx. Material description: Oxford cloth + PE Oxford cloth Product performance:The Laundry Hamper use Oxford cloth fabric,the inner layer is waterproof, which makes the basket have better wear resistance and durability. Accessories structure: Double-layer fabrics, waterproof lining, with a beam opening device to prevent dust from entering and keep the internal items clean and dry. Two handles on both sides, comfortable and durable. Washing instructions: It is recommended to wash in cold water, do not bleach, to be durable.Wipe clean only, do not use abrasive cleaner and washing machine to clean the laundry bags, it will damage the PE coating. Ideal Choice for Home：Large laundry bag is the answer to all storage problems. Clothes basket would make laundry storage ever easier for dorm, nursery, apartment and more. Tired of seeing dirty clothes everywhere? Large laundry basket is your best laundry partner!! Whether you need to collect your laundry, organize your clothes, or put toys in order, this spacious laundry hamper bag is always your best choice. Portable clothes hamper for College dorms, Campers, Apartments, Hotel stay, Baby nurseries, Utility room and Shopping. Kind Reminder：This laundry hamper can't stand well when it's empty. The Laundry Baskets are shipped in folded form, so the hampers for laundry you received is wrinkled, but please do not worry and this is not the product quality issue. You can put a few blankets inside and use a steamer to remove the creases. Your satisfaction is our first pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aVtVTnrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Janrely","source_asin":"B08YRYHS2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRYHS2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YRYHS2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
