window.products.push({"id":280321,"name":"Silicone Kitchen Cooking Utensil Set, EAGMAK 14PCS Stainless Steel Silicone Kitchen Utensils Spatula Set with Stand for Nonstick Cookware, BPA Free No","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EEA2dx07L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Complete Set of Cooking Utensils：This 14pcs kitchen utensil set that contains almost anything you will need for cooking most meals. They include Slotted Spatula, Slotted Spoon, Slotted Turner, Large Flexible Spatula, Solid Turner, Pasta Server, Solid Spoon, Skimmer, Deep Soup Ladle, Whisk, Kitchen Tongs and Basting Brush. A must keep for every home. They would be your great companion in the kitchen. Food Grade Safe Silicone：Made of food-grade silicone, BPA-free, soft but duty and very pliable, safe to use in any type of food. You don’t have to worry about the health of your families, this silicone cooking utensils does not react with food or beverages, or produce any hazardous fumes. And it will probably last longer than the other plastic kitchen utensils. Heat-Resistant & Stain-Resistant & Easier to Clean：This kitchen utensis can withstand very high heat, up to 446°F/230°C. If you're using silicone turners in cooking, you don't have to worry that it will melt when you accidentally leave it in the pot for a while. And it doesn't retain odors or colors when you use it for stirring deep-colored food like tomato-based food products. They are easy to clean, we recommend the best way to clean these silicone cookware is gently rinsing in warm water. Durable Stainless Steel Handle & Utensil Stand：Made from quality stainless steel which is rust resistant for long-lasting reliability, and more durable than wood handle as they will not crack after extended use. And Anti scalding silicone handle sleeve protect your hand from burning. 6 hooks allow you to hang all your kitchen gadget utensil set conveniently, help save your counter space and keep tidy. Great Gift for Your Families/Friends：This set of kitchen utensils has everything you need to get started with your kitchen or replace your current set, you can use these tools to make curry, pasta sauces and soups etc. It’s an ideal gift for anyone who loves to cook, a nice gift set for any occasion, perfect for Mother’s Father’s Day, birthdays, Christmas, wedding showers, as a housewarming present, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EEA2dx07L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EAGMAK","source_asin":"B08C51S6B5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C51S6B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C51S6B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
