window.products.push({"id":280488,"name":"HiGoing Kids Insulated Water Bottle, 17 oz Kids Thermos, 12 Hour Double-Wall Insulation, LED Anti-Scalding Reminder, BPA-Free, Stainless Steel Water B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+UtZawvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Unique LED Anti-Scalding Reminder】We have designed an easy to understand temperature warning light on the thermos. Touch the \"back of the head\" and the indicator will light up. The blue light indicates that the beverage temperature is below 113°F, which is suitable for drinking. A red light indicates that the temperature of the beverage is higher than 113°F, which has the risk of scalding. Note: Please check the temperature of water in bottle is drinkable ❄【Patented Anti-Splash Design】The thermos water bottle has a unique anti-splash and anti-scald patented design. When you open the water bottle to drink hot water and you will not be scalded by the overflowing hot water. It also can effectively prevents hot beverages from splashing and scalding children. ***we will give you an extra straw for drinking ice water ❄【Premium Materials Insulated Bottle】The insulated water bottle is made of 316 stainless steel, which has the characteristics of anti-oxidation, anti-corrosion and tasteless. It adopts double-layer vacuum insulation technology also can keep the beverage cold or hot for 12 hours! The original flavor of the drink and water is retained. The straw is our exclusive patented technology and it's made of medical grade silicone, soft, non-toxic, 100% BPA free and FDA certification ❄【Easy to Clean Insulated Water Bottle】The patented inner cover sealing technology. It improves the thermal insulation performance and simplifies the structure and effectively reducing the sanitary corners. The gasket and straw can be easily removed. In addition to the lid, the stainless steel kettle can be washed in the dishwasher. The lid (IPX6 waterproof) can be washed directly ❄【Easy to Carry Thermos Water Bottle】We have prepared carry straps and cup sleeve for each style of insulated water bottle. The insulated water bottle carrying case is convenient for children to take when going out. Each set comes with an exquisite gift box, which is the perfect gift for your kids","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c+UtZawvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HiGoing","source_asin":"B08Y8923ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y8923ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y8923ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
