window.products.push({"id":280533,"name":"T4U Cool Mist Humidifiers USB 320ML, Ultrasonic Humidifiers with Small Plant Container, Air Diffuser for for Desktop Office Bedroom with Nightlight Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61piuwd20UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultrasonic Cool mist tech】- The humidifier diffuser uses ultrasonic technology to increase humidity in your home and office. Its portable size and extra-long USB cable of 6.56 feet make it easy to carry and use. Cool mist emitted by the humidifier can effectively relieve the symptoms related to air dryness, which is an important part of a good sleep. 【Reliable night guard】- The ultrasonic humidifier operates quietly without causing any annoying noise. The smoothing built-in yellow night light can be turned on or turned off for your convenience. Great for your bedroom or baby's nursery. All you have to do is have a sweet dream. 【Auto shut off protection】- 320 ml of water allows up to 10 hours working time. The cool mist humidifier has two spraying modes: continuous and intermittent. No matter which mode is selected, the built-in 4-hour timer will cut off the power when the set time is reached, so as to avoid dry burn. It's super safe. 【Plastic pot for plant Lovers】- Mini plants suitable for growing in moist environment can be transferred to the white plastic pot of the mini humidifier, definitely adding a dash of greenery and vibrancy to your indoor space. (Plants Not Included) 【NOTICE】- Please use Tap Water for better performance. DO NOT fill the water tank with essential oil, warm water or filtered water. Don't use essential oils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61piuwd20UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T4U","source_asin":"B08PY5LYG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PY5LYG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PY5LYG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":280534,"name":"Tawetori Retro 70s Style Blossom Blanket Soft Throw Blanket Lightweight Flannel Halloween Blankets for Sofa Couch Bed Office Travel Camping 50inchX40i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWl1vfJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Delicate And Beautiful Life Needs Such A Tawetori Blanket To SnuggleGorgeous Colors Rejuvenate This Blanket And Have An Elegant, Outstanding Look That Complements Your Room. The Soft Blanket Is Not Only Light And Convenient To Carry Around But Also Enough To Withstand The Cold, It Is An Ideal Way To Maintain A Comfortable Life.MaterialThese Throw Blankets Are Constructed With Flannel Material Which Is Soft To Touch, Easy To Care For, And Lightweight At The Same Time.Your ChoiceThis Blanket Provides You With Incredible Soft Bedding Essential, Great For Sofa, Bed, Office, Camping, Cold Cinema, Or Traveling.Holiday GiftsExquisite Pattern Printing, Bright And Lively Colors, The Bed Throw Blanket Also Is A Perfect Gift For Your Family And Friends.Note:1:Machine Wash Cold, Line To Air Dry (Best Results), Or Tumble Dry In Low Heat.2:Due To Hand Cut And Hand Controlled Sewing, There May Be About 0.1-0.2 Inch Error.3:Sincerely Recommend That You Washing It Before First Use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWl1vfJSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tawetori","source_asin":"B09DDBCW9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DDBCW9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DDBCW9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":280535,"name":"Thermos Funtainer 12 Ounce Bottle, Sofia The First","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-E3xtS3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THERMOS products deliver what matters every time. As the leading manufacturer of convenient insulated products for over 100 years, THERMOS is trusted by consumers to provide innovative portable containers that promote a safe and healthy lifestyle. THERMOS delivers when it matters. THERMOS brand products offer superior cold retention that keeps beverages cool and delicious for hours, and the 12 ounce FUNtainer Straw Bottle is no exception. THERMOS vacuum insulation technology virtually eliminates temperature change within the beverage container by creating an airless space between two stainless steel walls. The result is an insulation layer that performs better than any other. A superior insulated container you can depend on to keep your child’s beverages colder, fresher, longer. This hydration bottle keeps beverages cold up to 12 hours – more than 10 times longer than an ordinary plastic water bottle. Constructed with double wall stainless steel, this 12 ounce straw bottle is virtually unbreakable and built to withstand the demands of everyday use. Featuring a hygienic, push-button lid, this straw bottle is easy to open and drink from. Also included on the lid is an integrated, flip-up carrying loop. The THERMOS FUNtainer Straw Bottle comes equipped with a breakaway lid designed to simply snap off if accidentally dropped while the lid is open. The lid can then be easily snapped back into place, making this a great, worry-free choice for parents and kids alike. In order to maximize the incredible insulation technology, it is recommended to pre-chill the bottle just prior to use. This can be accomplished by filling the bottle with cold tap water, attaching the lid and letting it rest for a few minutes. Before you are ready to use, simply empty the water and fill with your favorite beverage. Attaching the lid will further increase the thermal efficiency. The FUNtainer Straw Bottle is made of BPA-free materials and is backed by a five-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-E3xtS3rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B07QP5CG2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QP5CG2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QP5CG2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":280536,"name":"Down To Earth Stainless Steel Wire Artichoke Steamer and Holder Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813TTaeAetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steaming brings out the light sweetness and nutty flavor buried deep in each artichoke thistle. The artichoke is a flower that grows mainly in the Mediterranean region and in California. The artichoke steamer is the perfect accessory for cooking perfect artichokes every time. This steamer basket is a stainless-steel construction and holds the artichoke upright ensuring balanced cooking. Place the steamer in a deep pan with 1” water and steam 25-35 minutes depending on the size of the artichoke. Bon Appetit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813TTaeAetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Down to Earth","source_asin":"B000N5DH4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000N5DH4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000N5DH4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
