window.products.push({"id":280638,"name":"Cardinal Wooden Candle Holder for Couple, I'm Always with You Candle Holder Cardinal Candle Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SBZbxTRTL._AC_.jpg","description":"And So Together They Built A Life They Loved Candle Holder with Heart Gift Candle Holder This candle holder with a message will make the perfect personal Gift Best Friend, Gift Ideas For Mom, Best Gift For Husband, Mother/Father Day, Valentines Day, Christmas, New Year, Easter, Wedding... and the message is a constant reminder of how great your love to them. 1. Lightweight Material: made of wood, durable and eco-friendly. 2. Unique design: two candlesticks together to form a heart shape, looks really romantic. 3. Adding radiance: add a different style to your home, let you feel warm and comfortable. 4. Best gift: great wedding gifts and Valentines Day gifts, Christmas gift, birthday gift,... 5. Use place: charming decoration for weddings, home, bars, hotels. etc. Product details: TWO DIFFERENT SIZES: Two Different Candle Holder Sizes: the shorter tealight holder at 3.7” x 1.85”, the higher tea lights holder at 4.5” x 1.85” SPECIAL DESIGN: The two candle holders could be used separately or stand side by side. HIGH QUALITY: Made from high Oak wood or pine wood. The innovative UV printing keeps the print image sharp. So, the message will not fade and stay forever. Shipping & Delivery : Shipping: Estimated Processing time: 3-6 business days. Estimated US Shipping time: 7-14 business days. Depending on the epidemic situation PERFECT FOR BOTH INDOOR AND OUTDOOR USE. Pro Tip: Buying 2 products or more at the same time will save you quite a lot on shipping fees. If you have any problem with the product you received, contact us as soon as possible, please do not give us a bad review. Let us handle it, give us the opportunity to serve you. We will handle the problem until you are satisfied. Thank for trust and choose our store !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SBZbxTRTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BG9RYGDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG9RYGDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG9RYGDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":280639,"name":"Classic Brands Serena Pillow Top Innerspring 10-Inch Mattress | Bed-in-a-Box California King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":403.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-WSFRugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Brands Serena Pillow Top Innerspring 10-Inch Mattress is constructed with tempered steel wrapped innerspring coils that improve the mattresses durability and longevity. The Classic innerspring mattress is an excellent value for a supportive and undisturbed sleep for years to come. The 10-inch profile Pillow-Top Innerspring Mattress has the ultimate support of a wrapped steel coil innerspring at the right price! The 8-inches of individually wrapped coils are encased in separate pockets so they can contour precisely to your body. Individually wrapped coil innerspring system moves independently and reduces the sensation of movement on a bed providing contouring comfort and support for an undisturbed night's sleep. There are two cushioning fiber layers on top and beneath the coils, which provide a buffer, so you never feel the coils, even after years of use. Individually Wrapped Coils Our 10-inch pillow top mattress consists of innerspring individual coils wrapped in a fabric designed to minimize friction and maximize support. The tempered steel coils tend to provide consistent distribution of support throughout the mattress and lessens motion transfer for sleep partners. Individually wrapped coils move independently and are encased in separate pockets so they can contour precisely to each person and provide, deep, comforting pressure relief, independent of body type. Comfort and Durability Our Serena pillow top mattress is both comfortable and durable. Overall, individually wrapped coils offer superior comfort and pressure relief over a traditional coil system. Although a traditional coil can be very comfortable when paired with the proper pressure relieving comfort layers, an individually wrapped coil is superior due to its ability to provide individualized contouring and motion separation for undisturbed rest. Also, wrapped coils are extremely durable and will last for years. They do not wear down over time making them a great support system for your body. Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to know the size and the height of your mattress ahead of time to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of your bed frame, foundation, or adjustable bed base with the height of your mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your sleep system will be. Twin Size - 39 W x 75 L x 10 H Twin XL Size - 39 W x 80 L x 10 H Full Size - 54 W x 75 L x 10 H Queen Size - 60 W x 80 L x 10 H King Size - 76 W x 80 L x 10 H California King Size - 72 W x 84 L x 10 H Classic Brands Smart Packaging Classic Brands also uses Smart Packaging. Smart packaging reduces the carbon footprint in the manufacturers shipping process. Our advanced packaging technology means we can roll-pack our mattresses and ship them at one-third of the normal size. Because of this process, we can ship more mattresses per delivery and reduce the amount of carbon emissions. A mattress that is roll-packed still retains its initial quality, as each will quickly recover and return to its original shape after being removed from its packaging. Quality Assurance The Classic Brands Serena mattress is backed with a worry-free 10-year . Look for more innovative specialty sleep products from Classic Brands","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r-WSFRugL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B098F2ZPPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098F2ZPPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098F2ZPPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
