window.products.push({"id":280711,"name":"Tidy Books® White Bookshelf for Kids (Age 0-10) 3D Alphabet Book Storage for Kids, Montessori, Book Rack for Kids, Front Facing, 45.3 x 30.3 x 2.8 in,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616+A3LQ2SL._AC_.jpg","description":"💚 WANT TO GET YOUR CHILD OFF SCREENS AND INTO BOOKS? Create an enticing reading nook with a Tidy Books white bookcase for kids, with 3D alphabet. I designed the original, award winning childrens bookshelf to make books enticing for your kids. Our montessori bookshelf makes it easy for your child to see and pick out books independently, and even put them back! As seen on TV on CBeebies and Homeland. 💚 BUILT TO LAST, STURDY AND SAFETY TESTED fixes safely to the wall. My strong white wall bookshelf will not bend under the weight of books, unlike many canvas imitations. Holds up to 85 picture books of all shapes & sizes. The panels keep books in place, and the closed back means books can't slip. Space saving; this kids narrow bookshelf fits behind a door. The Original Tidy Books may be more expensive than the imitations, but its sturdy, classic design means it will last for years. Self assembly. 500 💚 AWARD WINNING, LOVED BY PARENTS & GRANDPARENTS WORLDWIDE. I created the now Iconic Tidy Books tier bookshelf for kids in 2004 for my own children and it changed the way kids books are presented in the home. Join parents and grandparents around the world who want to instill a love of books early on. Our wall mount bookshelf is ideal for your baby's room, to make books a natural part of your child's world. It will be loved for 10 years and can be passed down through the family. \" 💚 ECO-FRIENDLY, HANDMADE, KIDS WOOD BOOKSHELF Each handmade item is individual with a natural craft look in style and finish. Made from sustainable wood and plywood. No MDF. Non toxic water lacquer finish (low VOCs.) My background as a violin maker means I am passionate about how products are made. We could have coated them with a solvent based acrylic lacquer, but I made an ethical choice. Water lacquer shows the natural imperfections in the wood, and is better for the planet and your kids 💚SHOP SMALL & SUSTAINABLY. At Tidy Books we believe that when you shop thoughtfully, your purchase will last you a lifetime, meaning less landfill and shipping. THE ORIGINAL SINCE 2004. Bookshelves for kids room and other nursery storage furniture, designed by founder and mom Geraldine to foster kids independence, and supports childrens reading charity Coram Beanstalk. Tidy Books changed the way kids books are presented in the home to encourage a love of books from an early age. Choose well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616+A3LQ2SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tidy Books","source_asin":"B07CCKXWHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CCKXWHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CCKXWHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
