window.products.push({"id":280833,"name":"EDELIN Measuring Cups and Magnetic Measuring Spoons Set, Stainless Steel 5 Cups and 7 Spoons and 1 Levele (Full magnetic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-qB6BZOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy Quality & Friendly - Set of 5 Staninless Steel Cups with Nonslip Silicone Handles Includes 1 cup, 1/2 cup, 1/3 cup, 1/4 cup, 1/8 cup. Precise quantity of ingredients is what you need to get great results with cooking and baking. You can also make tasty recipes to help you lose weight with these amazing spoons. New Upgrade & Easy to Read - Set of 8 Double Sided Stackable Stainless Steel Magnetic Spoons Includes 1 tbsp, 1/2 tbsp, 1 tsp, 3/4 tsp, 1/2 tsp, 1/4 tsp, 1/8 tsp, 1leveler. This package is now upgraded to Included is a stainless steel leveler with engraved measurement markings for accurate and extra-easy leveling. New Magnetic Measuring Cups - Magnetic Feature - Stick to Fridge. The strong magnets embedded on the handles make it easy to stick them on your refrigerator and keep them together in your utensil drawer, perfect for limited storage space. No trouble in picking one up for use and then putting back stacked for storage. Nonslip Measuring Cups Handles - These stainless steel measuring cups are designed with nonslip silicone handles for those wet or greasy hands. Magnetic Measuring Cups & Spoons - The magnetic stackable design of the measuring spoons allows you to easily take a part and use what you need and nest and store the rest. Two Measuring Spoons in One - These double-sided measuring spoons are like getting two sets of spoons in one. No more hassles of washing and reusing the same spoon. The round end is great for liquids and the narrow end for small spice jars. They also have a convenient stackable magnetic design! This Premium 13-piece stainless steel measuring cup and measuring spoon set is a must-have for any well-equipped kitchen. They provide accurate measurements of ingredients for all your baking and cooking needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-qB6BZOdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDELIN","source_asin":"B09W8S9197","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W8S9197","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W8S9197","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
