window.products.push({"id":280877,"name":"Uttermara Weighted Blanket Twin Size 18 Pounds 48x72 inches, Sherpa Weighted Blankets with Soft Plush Fleece & Cozy Warm Sherpa for Couch Sofa Bed, Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ChVAWetKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable & Stress-Relieving: Uttermara Weighted Blanket is embedded with glass beads to build up a heavier weight so that it can work on tired muscles. You will feel instant relief in its snuggles, drift off, and marvel at how revitalizing a restful night's sleep feels the next morning. Textured & Goodlooking: With premium flannel on one side and fluffy Sherpa on the other, the weighted blankets has a dual texture, providing you with double comfort and a luxurious feel to your decor. In addition, it features no fading, no shrinkage and no lint, thus avoiding deformation and discomfort for a longer service life. Innovative 7-Layer Design: The heavy blanket comes with Uttermara's classic 7-layer design. It consists of tightly sewn small squares filled with glass beads as small as 1mm. These beads are secured by glue-free polyester and brushed fabric to prevent them from clustering or moving around and to keep them evenly distributed. What's the Best Size: It is recommended that you choose a weighted blanket that weighs about 10% of your body weight, plus 1 lb. This adult weighted blanket is intended for individual use by people weighing approximately 170-190 lbs. Please refer to our size chart or contact us for more precise size information. Hassle-Free Care: Spot cleaning is recommended when the heavy weighted blanket gets dirty. If deep cleaning is required, use a commercial washing machine on a gentle cycle with cold water. If you have any issues, please contact us and we will resolve your concerns to your 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ChVAWetKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uttermara","source_asin":"B0B8LT7DY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8LT7DY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8LT7DY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
