window.products.push({"id":280902,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, Heat Sealer, 2 in 1 Heat Sealer and Cutter Handheld Portable Bag Resealer for Plastic Bags Food Storage Snack Bag 2 Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kygVy1WAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Heat Sealer and Cutter: After installing the battery, remove the hook. The \"+\" side is Heat Sealer, simply put the bag in and hold the sealer for 5 seconds then slide it along the edge of bags. If the material of the bag is thick, it needs to be pulled slowly and evenly. The \"-\" side is cutter. It can cuts plastic bag. No need to look around for a clip. Comes with a use manual. Compact and Portable: Unlike bulky bag vacuum sealer machine, this mini bag sealer length only 14 cm. It has a hook so you can hang it up with other utensils. Perfect portable bag sealer for kitchen, hunting, fishing, camping, travel and more. Ideal for Thanksgiving Day, Black Friday, Christmas gifts for your mother, friends and families. Heat Bag Sealer: Never worry about your containers leaking or opening and creating a mess in your purse when you head off to work; now you can keep your sandwich, fruit snack, salad, or any other food safe and sound! Always keep your chips, snack and food fresh and crispy! Keep rodents and bugs out of the food! Keep Foods Fresh： Seal all your food for airtight food storage with our mini heat sealer machine. Reseal any plastic bags for longer freshness and flavor. You can seal your snacks, chips, cereal bags, meats, leftovers, etc. to keep it from becoming stale. Please Note: The bag sealer needs 2 X AA batteries ( not included). When the battery power is insufficient, the sealing effect will be affected. Please replace the battery. Please remove the battery if it is not used for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kygVy1WAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYORUN","source_asin":"B089CJV86F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CJV86F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CJV86F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":280903,"name":"9GreenBox Star Jasmine/Confederate Jasmine (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gp3nOeZ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ORIGINS OF STAR JASMINE PLANTS: also commonly known as confederate jasmine or angelwing jasmine, this evergreen plant originates from China; a very versatile plant, it can be a twining vine that crawls up wire frames and grows up to 25’-30’ tall outdoors, as groundcover or in containers; the confederate jasmine plant is well-loved by many as it sports luscious green leaves and small, wonderfully fragrant star-shaped flowers; besides, it’s a hardy plant that doesn’t need a lot of care EASY CARING FOR THE CONFEDERATE JASMINE VINE: the white star jasmine is very easy to grow as it’s a rather hardy plant; you can place at sunny spots and it can withstand temperatures of between 10-15 degrees F; just remember that the more sun the plant gets, the more watering it needs; otherwise, you just need to water your jasmine confederate every 10-14 days; it’s good to remember that while the plant isn’t water-hungry, it’s not drought-resistant either FERTILIZING AND PRUNING THE STAR JASMINE LIVE PLANT: the confederate star jasmine can still thrive even without fertilizing; however, if you wish to fertilize them, simply add a layer of organic compost or general fertilizer on the soil; the star jasmine doesn’t need a lot of pruning either; you may prune it when it goes somewhere you don’t want it to or the dead, brown bits WONDERFULLY FRAGRANT STAR JASMINE FLOWERS: many people love the confederate jasmine because it has white, star-shaped flowers that will fill the whole house with a wonderful fragrance 9GreenBox Offers Live Plants - actual sizes and shape varies from pictures shown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gp3nOeZ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"9GreenBox","source_asin":"B00UMAZTCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-280903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UMAZTCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UMAZTCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
